      "score": 0.419,
      "guidance": "Use platform roles and traits (Compose semantics{role, contentDescription, heading()}, SwiftUI accessibilityLabel/.accessibilityAddTraits, RN accessibilityRole, WinUI/WPF AutomationProperties + AutomationPeer for custom controls); merge descendants so a card is one element; announce async status with live regions/announceForAccessibility. Test with TalkBack/VoiceOver/Narrator, not only by reading code.",
